    "z1": 4080
   },
   "text": "The foreman. He sat at his desk and put the shotgun under his chin.\nThe wall behind him is covered in it."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 5610,
    "z0": 4607,
    "x1": 6800,
    "z1": 5355
   },
   "text": "Letters on Umbrella letterhead. \"The gondola contract is approved in full.\"\n\"The samples are to be kept cold and are not to be opened.\"\n\"Discretion is a condition of the contract.\""
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 4250,
    "z0": 4607,
    "x1": 5610,
    "z1": 5355
   },
   "text": "The payroll ledger. Twenty-one names.\nHe crossed them out, one by one. The last ones aren't crossed out. There was nobody left to do it."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 1870,
    "z0": 4930,
    "x1": 3400,
    "z1": 5525
   },
   "text": "A safe. It's locked.\nA combination dial: three numbers."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 1700,
    "z0": 4080,
    "x1": 2720,
    "z1": 5610
   },
   "text": "A map of the camp, drawn by hand. Somebody marked a red X by the workshop."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 6120,
    "z0": 2635,
    "x1": 7820,
    "z1": 3740
   },
   "text": "A desk fan, still running. The power's still on somewhere."
  }
